@* Root component mounted by the Desktop host's BlazorWebView ("RootComponents.Add<Routes>("#app")").
   No actual client-side routing exists yet — there is exactly one surface in this phase (the
   read-only map canvas) — so this simply composes MainLayout around MapCanvas rather than
   introducing a Router/RouteView pair with nothing to route between. A real @page-based router
   arrives once the Map Library, dialogs and options panel (Phases 4-6) add further pages. *@
@namespace RhinoSurfaceMapper.UI.Components.Layout
@using RhinoSurfaceMapper.UI.Components.Map

<MainLayout>
    <MapCanvas />
</MainLayout>
